    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815100/extras/3ad5cccf9ed5f6269eda5a179665d0a7.poster.avif?t=1752258188\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815100/extras/3ad5cccf9ed5f6269eda5a179665d0a7.webp?t=1752258188\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=80 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soulscape 2: Fragments of the Present</strong> is a turn-based, story-rich CRPG set in the dystopian near future The game features a psychological narrative, choice-based dialogue, strategic party combat, and a branching storyline shaped by your actions and inner demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815100/extras/3a4445e8141ab5fc0e526059f150ed96.poster.avif?t=1752258188\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815100/extras/3a4445e8141ab5fc0e526059f150ed96.webp?t=1752258188\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=80 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Turn-Based Combat</strong></u><strong>\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle using an old-school turn-based tactical combat system that will force Blake and his party to go head-to-head against mechanized robotic defense systems. Designed by Cyberpulse - these machines, as well as their agents, are trying to stop the party from uncovering the truth.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815100/extras/cd3b2d62717cacec7baa590defa740f5.poster.avif?t=1752258188\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815100/extras/cd3b2d62717cacec7baa590defa740f5.webm?t=1752258188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Point and Click Adventure Mechanics</u>\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, investigate and uncover the truth about the world surrounding Blake and his companions. Unravel what's really happening in these eerie corporate settings, grungy bars and mystical science fiction research facilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815100/extras/1fea907ec4d97b340ccc077119e93b89.poster.avif?t=1752258188\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815100/extras/1fea907ec4d97b340ccc077119e93b89.webm?t=1752258188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815100/extras/1fea907ec4d97b340ccc077119e93b89.mp4?t=1752258188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Different Narratives, &amp; Relationships</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take charge of relationships with your squad members by romancing or distrusting them as you journey together. Your decisions will impact whether the party will grow closer or the conflict will cause a rift. Different endings will influence how you shape your story.\u00a0 <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815100/extras/38321b5c02f8fd6da79c8cf0d8e1743d.poster.avif?t=1752258188\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815100/extras/38321b5c02f8fd6da79c8cf0d8e1743d.webm?t=1752258188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Rich Cutscenes\u00a0and Cinematic RPG</u>\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The CRPG experience is supplemented by a rich variety of gameplay cutscenes to immerse and engage. Blake will feel the wrath of his enemies as he faces unparalleled internal and external threats. Will you succumb to your demonic lone-wolf tendencies and face threats alone? Or will you band together with your party and win as a team? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815100/extras/13d13097e3e1231e6ff18239e5538663.poster.avif?t=1752258188\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815100/extras/13d13097e3e1231e6ff18239e5538663.webm?t=1752258188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The story takes place in the year 2194 where Union Spire (U.S.) an American west coast city is under the clutches of a morally lacking, profit-driven nefarious corporation called Cyberpulse. You play as Blake Turner, a former Cyberpulse ex-operative who has survived an attempted assassination by his corporation and left to die. Joined by a group of childhood friends and romantic interests from Cyberpulse who save you in your dying breath to uncover the secret project of Cyberpulse that led to Blake\u2019s attempted assassination, you must fight your way to find out the truth. </i><br> <br><i><strong>FEATURE SUMMARY:\u00a0</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u00a0</strong></i><u><strong>Turn-Based Combat</strong></u><strong>\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Point and Click Adventure Mechanics</strong></u><strong>\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Different Narratives, &amp; Relationships</strong></u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Rich Cutscenes\u00a0and Cinematic RPG</strong></u><strong>\u00a0 </strong><br> <br> </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815100/extras/3ad5cccf9ed5f6269eda5a179665d0a7.poster.avif?t=1752258188\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815100/extras/3ad5cccf9ed5f6269eda5a179665d0a7.webp?t=1752258188\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=80 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soulscape 2: Fragments of the Present</strong> is a turn-based, story-rich CRPG set in the dystopian near future The game features a psychological narrative, choice-based dialogue, strategic party combat, and a branching storyline shaped by your actions and inner demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815100/extras/3a4445e8141ab5fc0e526059f150ed96.poster.avif?t=1752258188\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815100/extras/3a4445e8141ab5fc0e526059f150ed96.webp?t=1752258188\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=80 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Turn-Based Combat</strong></u><strong>\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle using an old-school turn-based tactical combat system that will force Blake and his party to go head-to-head against mechanized robotic defense systems. Designed by Cyberpulse - these machines, as well as their agents, are trying to stop the party from uncovering the truth.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815100/extras/cd3b2d62717cacec7baa590defa740f5.poster.avif?t=1752258188\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.