ecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Rich Cutscenes\u00a0and Cinematic RPG</u>\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The CRPG experience is supplemented by a rich variety of gameplay cutscenes to immerse and engage. Blake will feel the wrath of his enemies as he faces unparalleled internal and external threats. Will you succumb to your demonic lone-wolf tendencies and face threats alone? Or will you band together with your party and win as a team? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815100/extras/13d13097e3e1231e6ff18239e5538663.poster.avif?t=1752258188\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815100/extras/13d13097e3e1231e6ff18239e5538663.webm?t=1752258188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The story takes place in the year 2194 where Union Spire (U.S.) an American west coast city is under the clutches of a morally lacking, profit-driven nefarious corporation called Cyberpulse. You play as Blake Turner, a former Cyberpulse ex-operative who has survived an attempted assassination by his corporation and left to die. Joined by a group of childhood friends and romantic interests from Cyberpulse who save you in your dying breath to uncover the secret project of Cyberpulse that led to Blake\u2019s attempted assassination, you must fight your way to find out the truth. </i><br> <br><i><strong>FEATURE SUMMARY:\u00a0</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u00a0</strong></i><u><strong>Turn-Based Combat</strong></u><strong>\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Point and Click Adventure Mechanics</strong></u><strong>\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Different Narratives, &amp; Relationships</strong></u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Rich Cutscenes\u00a0and Cinematic RPG</strong></u><strong>\u00a0 </strong><br> <br> </p></li></ul>",
